  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ed39b3668da73f89c48ae0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好，这次会让人见识到怎么样的表现呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25a734449a75ecfc8aa601dacdd1da8b3603dda6d9a09ddb995c57eaec459f5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c86356c63cd1d1a8493136",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也是令人目不转睛的一战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f96b53e12056ad9339a6ddaec77dea4ca7b9c3217d114ee77e593313f373f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6e5c18e48cfe28e82d4116",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得4胜，是超受瞩目的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ec7de914611ba3374d5cc6478cce1544d0b54e59b00f06605992dea95768d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:714704a283ead13ee868c4f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为「最强赛马娘」的会是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "120451aedbe89f63a3bd1780baa3591903fee909c89bc57eff444d46b8b631a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29d57b8adf1e7e2ff478a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为「最强赛马娘」的会是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "120451aedbe89f63a3bd1780baa3591903fee909c89bc57eff444d46b8b631a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d821edca7394a857ceafd169",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为「最强赛马娘」的会是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "120451aedbe89f63a3bd1780baa3591903fee909c89bc57eff444d46b8b631a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67b681b86b2bbc6b6cf54f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为惊人的80%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d8da7bf63ff0abe46ed3e46d9aa44b02198dcdb438bd60fc94b5b21c23b67f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a9601f3a64e978d38682024",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beda041d80e8df4f73bcacaba420066a331ec471e7012c9ad3c0840e7b2d8de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:902d3c0231338b277527c525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是无论何时都会让人想声援她的赛马娘。也是值得寄托梦想的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d50c1dc78e5bb5594ba978e6bfcda39e57de91637047361cd0f9a77765de5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5cdbcbb6ca9b82a4496f73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是无论何时都会让人想声援她的赛马娘。也是值得寄托梦想的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d50c1dc78e5bb5594ba978e6bfcda39e57de91637047361cd0f9a77765de5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b7d4bcfaef7b36b4da1842",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是无论何时都会让人想声援她的赛马娘。也是值得寄托梦想的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d50c1dc78e5bb5594ba978e6bfcda39e57de91637047361cd0f9a77765de5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c44f39f4a8d24f395e4dff6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的梦想和你的梦想，将要起步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0385ec307151bf46dc632c099623eb2894c90896832794d63849c157caa4cd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed458108d594a597d9b86bb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的梦想和你的梦想，将要起步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0385ec307151bf46dc632c099623eb2894c90896832794d63849c157caa4cd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2476d0d4cebdb2462f747502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的梦想和你的梦想，将要起步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0385ec307151bf46dc632c099623eb2894c90896832794d63849c157caa4cd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf66ee85075382b01f239924",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实力毫无疑问位于最高等级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0f02125e2af70b91be86c58306eaaf15a0331ef04a8015d0b01fc8a9ac7b4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9773bd7b3a1d88a3957f768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现足以让周遭众人感到畏缩的压倒性表现，是强者中的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd58bbb8e556a245273df302808a178f75a8796ac5557a71f2e99214becc7c2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa27a8322114ac8e53c4790",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝不会让人期待落空，<color=#ff9900>「<trainer_name>」</color>的心腹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a4c949eb3ccb34d743e621f43691e1ba5045ed3830c035da543d36911282aef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:675b9dc6e12229ba6577fafa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这一战也绝对不容错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2fe2d841f33358fad7a9464e54ae09a165020938935018740a93fe2989eb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8184bc047bcfbba9f0811d44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次竞赛也最被看好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f079e9dcf0b1214a62ed234ae534b9a1416a7727853363cb71b81f09066ad8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cf41fd2343127c4191719e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也要在此累积胜利，朝更高的目标迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f143c6cdf5bf01e93860ca7afd55c2f556ab9097589436b5dfb614be93ad46c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fc60115a708687a5d86d21e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战全都获胜，状态绝佳的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87ba153b19f8e0b871fc998e0bc2fa6ddb6367d240d594e14ad0fd09f5573545",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079290ccaf6d256ed5033bc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率竟然为100%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ce8135aeebff6b882737d7531e4f169771736b613d142946cbe6c4027e36cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7feaf4b247b22da8cd56e9a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beda041d80e8df4f73bcacaba420066a331ec471e7012c9ad3c0840e7b2d8de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90fdc7a797ead42ce155a1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简直难以想象她败北的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53097f7ac338225d225a3ebffcbee407317d8d2c32dfebd0f0deef45681947cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3db6207547a24a8feea200b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经散发出令人感觉到王者风范的气势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91adafd43b00043fe0a6356b35f3991d6fae99aa43cf381d6abddc80e20595b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c385e1e9955f25a217c67646",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的有能够战胜这名赛马娘的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f48688e53f8661a65b3028571958e0c956ba5237c84f6250e005beb12820516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1157de91ec4e222990afeae0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这股压倒性气势能够持续到何时？一定要看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9179758a482db57b9a31d23ae597f34554aecf11891a8173f6e3d5c6d2b15bdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd18eca14d7d0d8646242f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利唾手可得吗？让我们来看看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "574d89228e56830c788ccb845866f53167838d2cd7e6203f96c6612579f0025e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f69276065895ddb6105a7212",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "敬请期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dabf010f331d14415784a9f63a80a01d007cd1e563bd73d0e301d606146fb49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "15202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:416c6a644b52823864bd21c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然实力还不明了，但成为殿堂赛马娘之前的评价极佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "601c8d44a3b7b5ab1bceb92f175f029214c5f9a457d3c10878be61a158d25f37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eb6f70fbe9e27d3cb2992cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "曾在预赛取得第1名，实力坚强的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e941b20331f9048f0d482044f17f9a13bd61f76678b72c685c528fab44b2fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7d04097a34d19ff13a046d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前胜率25%，尝过胜利滋味的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ed59d1bc4e3d08c0ff5446f209ad6500e23083d099b20c0d1e11e31f1afa7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992489386178a5385f23b973",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>有获得第1名的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4372c17fee634a256a7a9da296fb0bc37198738ac2ba1bb51d9d9105bd3863d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d0f069c8ca94b8beeb8e2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实力还是未知数。务必要看看是否能将至今所累积的实力，透过对手展现出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bdb02b1e93988a5a79be6f7a6b61771ff4f13c192e6a2c298b35e19497a19d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805bd67fa3b06e6a4db8f7c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为殿堂赛马娘前在<single_battle_record>留有成绩，实力堪称一级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b6dc680367bb8b7ca2de5405e8abcc5984eb41e1949d725144a912a5fe5ff4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a2758e192609f88447cdae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是速度颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ecdb6105cd4acefb8e9728eea228b9ec1a13d0463dc2d58ab6afb5afa743f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b459e53b49031d42f26559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是耐力颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c09c124a0edadac10ac5f86c15f41987b51b085f1010d421093832e660eabd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfdbb7921e24fc32e4e5645",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是力量颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7836231f38cb7e7f546bc65606d163d95b9f73bae2036e4b2792861b9b6f71a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e049fcfd4d04672b0aa7345",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是根性颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63affc6c6aa1ecc3cbb2a7d8d93e13429fd6f56d512a8b7c63c7ddbda6de1a44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c87c10485065da5d88e6a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是智力颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da292a82be23d15f5546c141713344a330cf11fbc7e550ef7bfc8689fa28272d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f375896de1fde28524a34291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是领放战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ab363b8d022832858cda1f9f887e5348975646219e5ea360a6d9f0e97d4498",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:833029bae7b85d34cc53ae26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是先行战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334b1aaae3b960a2ba77134468b77e2ea14cdfe6b041ed79a9459f27990cbe0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febdbf9a4c639d6a23c006c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是居中战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e640ce330a8ec89e2da4423d1bbc807331fb91997554d425dc0df9657b9c24ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a2d6a1e478f264f65207fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "情势变得有利后所展现出那精彩的表现让人目不转睛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "013fb77ed981a8093cc7665247e922f408a9aa0b7594344946a8efc8b2be0450",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f10c943676c48b8bd22399d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为体验过胜利和败北，她的实力才值得期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4cc9f966a26e43324a2cf09c394aa9a91f87d966f011d4e0d87dc127cf669f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76464799d213398841af5f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来也越来越适应<race_course>的<race_distance>了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e79fd358c5f76195c9fbc3dcdc91e27d9fa3c5a5af49bf395ee7917de5daaccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c50f895ab63ad7f0b2b905",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是追赶战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "796796cc36673153bb912ed0d74f0f02043991c9c1f5127a59f7bb247ec22066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
