      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac7f005c91ef17b0bbb5923",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是这场竞赛中必须关注的1人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "067582d58c57a43b238ccf428467b5657668953e9a0c0a5281f651e7816d944a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd3312c32c74178b397da685",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是否还能增添更多胜场数呢，令人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d39f766c9330ee0d79721b3a065d69d28a18a49825c65296b89bf16a74ac727",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2b3e3b77b1a8151f505421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第2场胜利已经触手可及，出赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5bfa3adf17549106ba6f605308c35c72bab5c194daf6c4c483d9c59616a653",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1883c1f74db37f1bacd1f7aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的领放战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6b51ea5fcdae1e69e842768c5ef6f5bb7bcd726262432c987aebc36c2d9ea4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44637e59c438cc68a14c1555",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的先行战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e56fa9c57e27c33d90a2da6eb351da6f23a29c5ccedf547a71ba27c12cb10b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30af3e56ee40655fefe24261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的居中战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b51f0cc810ecf9abf3f4bbda04be4e3e87fbcc9ed50b31b25ae7e78565d653a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8019559da999023dd192fca5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的追赶战术掌握胜利吗！",
